%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as DiagnosisButton (frontend)
  participant API as POST /api/diagnostics
  participant SVC as service.startDiagnosis
  participant EV as evidence.buildIncidentContext
  participant DA as DevOps Agent (aidevops)
  participant CW as CloudWatch / Glue / Data API
  participant DDB as bgp-diagnostics
  FE->>API: {taskId, runId}
  API->>SVC: startDiagnosis()
  SVC->>DDB: create running record (return diagnosticId immediately)
  API-->>FE: {diagnosticId, status:running}
  par background fire-and-forget
    SVC->>EV: build the evidence prompt
    EV->>CW: pull real logs / errors (Glue ErrorMessage + /aws-glue/jobs/error / DescribeStatement)
    CW-->>EV: log excerpts
    SVC->>DA: ensureAgentSpace → CreateChat(userType=IAM) → SendMessage(evidence prompt)
    DA-->>SVC: event stream (contentBlockDelta.delta.textDelta.text accumulated)
    Note over SVC,DA: Reply too short (<300 chars, no "root cause / fix") → one follow-up question to get the full report
    SVC->>DDB: Update status=done + report (or failed + error)
  and frontend polling
    loop every 3 s, ≤100 times
      FE->>API: GET /api/diagnostics/{id}
      API-->>FE: {status, report?}
    end
  end
  Note right of FE: status=done → show the structured report in a dialog
